{"name": "Kristala", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"524\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/850297e7d56dcb115395f49cdb3e135f.avif?t=1787077820\" width=\"1200\"/></span>Unleash your arcane power in Kristala\u2014a dark fantasy ARPG with <strong>challenging combat</strong>, <strong>fluid parkour</strong>, and <strong>deep exploration</strong>. Step into the role of a feline warrior destined to uncover the source of a deadly curse threatening your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"43\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/0eacb5ef3874c44b39fee6ad30ee5f20.webp?t=1787077820\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Punishing &amp; Satisfying Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Avoid damage by blocking, dodging, and deflecting attacks. Combine light and heavy attacks, utilize powerful weapon abilities, and cast up to 16 equipped spells at a time. Regenerate Mana by engaging in melee combat \u2014 deflect attacks to land critical takedowns.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/6572c8656e1b196e0ebae23de774d695.poster.avif?t=1787077820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/6572c8656e1b196e0ebae23de774d695.webm?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/6572c8656e1b196e0ebae23de774d695.mp4?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat Cursed Monsters with Cunning Skill</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ailur is slowly being overcome by a dark and mysterious curse. Use your arsenal of weapons, spells, and unique feline abilities to battle undead enemies, tortured spirits, and behemoth bosses with cunning agility and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/24bd78b1305ce726753f50030c82cf7e.poster.avif?t=1787077820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/24bd78b1305ce726753f50030c82cf7e.webm?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/24bd78b1305ce726753f50030c82cf7e.mp4?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overcome Obstacles with Feline Parkour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Execute unique abilities that allow you to traverse the environment in many ways, overcoming new + exciting challenges. New traversal abilities are unlocked by progressing Kristala\u2019s main storyline + each new skill opens up new pathways in previously explored areas.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/61c3cb823b047914a8e28c2365cd3bcb.poster.avif?t=1787077820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/61c3cb823b047914a8e28c2365cd3bcb.webm?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/61c3cb823b047914a8e28c2365cd3bcb.mp4?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Piece Together the Lore through Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use your arsenal of skills to explore the diverse, dark-fantasy world of Ailur, seeking out written journal pickups, impactful NPC interactions, and unique Kristal Memory items to unravel Kristala's detailed story and lore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/6862fa8a532288c37bdc961c979ae02f.poster.avif?t=1787077820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/6862fa8a532288c37bdc961c979ae02f.webm?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/6862fa8a532288c37bdc961c979ae02f.mp4?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Create Your Own Unique Feline Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose your desired fur pattern/length. Your clan choice determines the type of magic you'll level throughout the game, and your starting class determines your initial weapon, armor, and stat loadouts. Level stats, magic, and feline abilities to fit your desired play style.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"656\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/4147205a3365269c5b69ab01bde01484.poster.avif?t=1787077820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/4147205a3365269c5b69ab01bde01484.webm?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/4147205a3365269c5b69ab01bde01484.mp4?t=1787077820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"43\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/0eacb5ef3874c44b39fee6ad30ee5f20.webp?t=1787077820\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Future of Kristala</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since launch, community feedback has helped shape the future of Kristala in meaningful ways. As we continue refining, optimizing, and expanding the world of Ailur, we're excited to share a look at some of our current focuses and long-term plans for the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note that features and priorities may evolve throughout development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras_big/0ab95815bf985bf087faa42f85e61a6a.avif?t=1787077820\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/extras/0ab95815bf985bf087faa42f85e61a6a.avif?t=1787077820\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Kristala is a dark fantasy ARPG featuring challenging combat, fluid parkour, and deep exploration. Master the ancient magic of the Sacred Six Kristals and uncover the source of a mysterious curse in a thrilling, story-driven adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206410/50b9fbfe601c9b5dd9dd8ff3734b6f1e4620c8f4/header.jpg?t=1787077820", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Fantasy", "Action", "Souls-like", "Action RPG", "Dark Fantasy", "Cats"], "developers": "Astral Clocktower Studios", "publishers": "Astral C